        {
            "id": "ann_1",
            "type": "note",
            "text": "POP + VOL Bridge \u2014 Particles Advected by Volume Field\n\nAdvectPOP reads a 3D velocity field from a NoiseVOL\nand pushes particles along the flow direction.\n\nThe top chain shows advected particles with gravity.\nThe bottom chain renders the velocity field itself.\n\nThis demonstrates the core POP\u2194VOL bridge:\nvolume data drives particle motion in real time.",
